    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "Fixed the covered panel edge. The layout had reserved a hard-coded 52 pixels, but FF8's rendered pager is 58 pixels tall. The shared view now measures and reserves the actual pager height; one-page views reserve nothing. At 1280×720 and 1600×900, both panels now end above the pager with no overlap.",
